{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a stapler. Choose a photocopier that always breaks. Choose a screen full of spreadsheets, numbers that mean nothing, and documents no one will ever read. Choose quiet humility. Or..., choose something else?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your job is a mystery.</strong> The files you\u2019re sorting don\u2019t make sense, the letters you type are nonsense. Your coworkers are frighteningly strange, and the office corridors are even more confusing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303400/extras/4ba04bff0b0ad18edf87e66808078eb9.poster.avif?t=1770712688\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303400/extras/4ba04bff0b0ad18edf87e66808078eb9.webm?t=1770712688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303400/extras/4ba04bff0b0ad18edf87e66808078eb9.mp4?t=1770712688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to become an employee of the month and get a promotion. But the decision is yours to make. Sabotage work and earn harsh punishment? Work hard and get a reward or try to escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303400/extras/c2eabef03ff02f73ca37ada7c1b72e34.poster.avif?t=1770712688\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303400/extras/c2eabef03ff02f73ca37ada7c1b72e34.webm?t=1770712688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303400/extras/c2eabef03ff02f73ca37ada7c1b72e34.mp4?t=1770712688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit a shrink glued to the sofa, ride the elevator, dance in the party room, and carry out your office routine while solving the mystery.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3303400?t=1770712688","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303400/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770712688","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303400/63f66354a1e397a2c9cf8c4cceed3df9412a9be9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770712688","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303400/63f66354a1e397a2c9cf8c4cceed3df9412a9be9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770712688","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a stapler. Choose a photocopier that always breaks. Choose a screen full of spreadsheets, numbers that mean nothing, and documents no one will ever read. Choose quiet humility. Or..., choose something else?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your job is a mystery.</strong> The files you\u2019re sorting don\u2019t make sense, the letters you type are nonsense. Your coworkers are frighteningly strange, and the office corridors are even more confusing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303400/extras/4ba04bff0b0ad18edf87e66808078eb9.poster.avif?t=1770712688\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"